{"id":"0efbe3f2d5d172f3","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-turing-ideal.md","title":"Turing Ideal","display":"df-turing-ideal — Turing Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-turing-ideal","aliases":["62-df-turing-ideal"],"display":"df-turing-ideal — Turing Ideal","depends_on":["[[62-df-turing-join]]","[[62-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem II.1.7 and following remark","source_pages":[64],"source_pdf_pages":[82]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-turing-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-turing-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-ideal — Turing Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d451f45281e1b22\" href=\"?note=5d451f45281e1b22\" title=\"62-df-turing-join\">62-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem II.1.7 and following remark"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 是元层集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d451f45281e1b22\" href=\"?note=5d451f45281e1b22\" title=\"62-df-turing-join\">62-df-turing-join</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{TIdeal}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal S\\;(A\\oplus B\\in\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(B\\le_T A\\to B\\in\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{TIdeal}(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal S\\;(A\\oplus B\\in\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(B\\le_T A\\to B\\in\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非空条件必需。它和向下闭包推出所有递归数集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 中；有限 join 闭包处理任意有限多个集合参数。此处的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\forall B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是外部元理论量词；不能把模型的有限已有集合域当成这个闭包检查的量化域。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem II.1.7 and following remark；纸面页 64；PDF 页 82。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"5d451f45281e1b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-2","tar